# Запити для VS Code REST Client або JetBrains HTTP Client. Спочатку register, потім підставте token.
@base = http://localhost:3002
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE
@webhookSecret = whsec-dev

### Реєстрація (новий tenant: перший користувач admin)
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tenantSlug": "acme", "email": "admin@acme.test", "password": "password123" }

### Логін (після npm run seed)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tenantSlug": "acme", "email": "admin@acme.test", "password": "password123" }

### Хто я
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Товари v1 / v2 / за прапорцем
GET {{base}}/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/v2/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Створити товар (admin)
POST {{base}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "KB-100", "name": "Клавіатура", "priceCents": 1999, "stock": 10 }

### Оптимістичне блокування: version обов'язкова
PATCH {{base}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "version": 1, "name": "Клавіатура Pro" }

### Soft delete і restore
DELETE {{base}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{base}}/products/{{productId}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Audit
GET {{base}}/audit?entity=product&entityId={{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Замовлення з Idempotency-Key (повторіть запит: Idempotent-Replayed: true)
POST {{base}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: order-demo-1

{ "items": [{ "productId": "{{productId}}", "qty": 2 }] }

### Вебхук провайдера (X-Signature = HMAC-SHA256 hex тіла з whsec-dev)
POST {{base}}/payments/webhook
Content-Type: application/json
X-Signature: {{signature}}

{"eventId":"evt-1","type":"payment.succeeded","orderId":"{{orderId}}","amountCents":3998}

### Checkout (саґа). X-Fail-Payment: 1 для відмови платежу, X-Crash-After: reserve_stock для імітації падіння
POST {{base}}/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [{ "productId": "{{productId}}", "qty": 1 }], "address": "Миколаїв, вул. Соборна 1" }

###
GET {{base}}/checkout/sagas/{{sagaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Circuit breaker: провайдер лежить
POST {{base}}/demo/payment-provider
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "failing": true, "latencyMs": 2000 }

###
GET {{base}}/demo/payment-provider/state
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Feature flags (admin)
PUT {{base}}/admin/flags/products-v2-default
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "enabled": true, "percentage": 30, "allowlist": [] }

###
GET {{base}}/flags/products-v2-default
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Файли: presign -> PUT за url (браузер) -> confirm
POST {{base}}/products/{{productId}}/images/presign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "contentType": "image/png", "size": 1024 }

###
POST {{base}}/products/{{productId}}/images/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "key": "{{key}}" }

###
GET {{base}}/products/{{productId}}/images
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Notifications
GET {{base}}/notifications/emails
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{base}}/demo/email-provider
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "failing": true }

###
GET {{base}}/notifications/dlq
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Profiling
POST {{base}}/demo/generate-orders?count=2000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/demo/slow-report
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{base}}/demo/fast-report
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
